1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,050
Ce mec a tapé

2
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:02,290
au plafond avec un balai

3
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,050
pour que son voisin

4
00:00:03,060 --> 00:00:04,130
baisse la musique.

5
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:04,670
À trois heures

6
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,390
du matin,

7
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,710
le voisin a répondu.

8
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,050
« Tape plus fort

9
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:08,210
! »

10
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,150
Alors il a tapé

11
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,390
plus fort et le plafond

12
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,150
