18
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:17,430
Alors ce con

19
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,190
a porté plainte

20
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,630
pour tapage nocturne.

21
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,530
Le juge a donné

22
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:21,463
