23
00:00:21,473 --> 00:00:22,050
Le plafond lui

24
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:22,850
appartenait,

25
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:23,410
et tout ce qu'il

26
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,370
