27
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:25,440
Putain,

28
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:26,000
depuis,

29
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:26,560
ce mec dort

30
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:27,440
